  9    when:
 10      java.referenced:
 11        pattern: org.springframework.beans.BeanInfoFactory
 12    description: Spring Framework 6.0 does not use Introspector anymore
 13    message: |
 14      The core container now performs basic bean property determination without `java.beans.Introspector` by default.
 15  
 16      In case of sophisticated JavaBeans usage, for full backwards compatibility with 5.3.x, specify the following content
 17      in a `META-INF/spring.factories` file, which enables 5.3-style full `java.beans.Introspector` usage:
 18      
 19      ```
 20      org.springframework.beans.BeanInfoFactory=org.springframework.beans.ExtendedBeanInfoFactory
 21      ```
 22    links:
 23    - title: 'Spring 6.0 migration guide'
 24      url: https://github.com/spring-projects/spring-framework/wiki/Spring-Framework-6.0-Release-Notes#core-container
