 37    message: |
 38      Methods annotated with @Async must return either Future or void. This has long been documented but is now also
 39      actively checked and enforced, with an exception thrown for any other return type.
 40      
 41      If your @Async annotated method does not return `Future` or `void`, please change its signature.
